      "comment": "BLACK XENA (7) boxed on well to finish second last time, beaten 0.8 lengths (22.23) behind Compare Joe at Ballarat. Rates highly and will give a great sight. ASTON GIOVANNI (2) box seated before sticking on well to finish 3.5 lengths away in third (25.64) at Shepparton in a Rank Limit - Grade 5 over 450m. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Expecting another good run. NIGHTTIME (1) is suited by the inside draw. Last start finished 4th on October 16 over 425m at this track behind Chappy's Totem beaten 8 lengths (24.43) in a Grade 5. Looks a key player on best form. MOOKAITE (8) must be included in main hopes on latest effort.",
